 "faq": [
  {
   "question": "What is the Season 1 arena set for Beast Mastery Hunter?",
   "answer": "The Gladiator's pieces: Gladiator's Chain Helm, Gladiator's Chain Spaulders, Gladiator's Chain Gauntlets, Gladiator's Chain Leggings, Gladiator's Decapitator. The 2-piece and 4-piece set bonuses carry over between seasons, so partial upgrades never break your bonus."
  },
  {
   "question": "What are the rating requirements in Season 1?",
   "answer": "Season 1 has no rating requirements — every piece is purchasable with points alone, which is why it remains the catch-up set all expansion."
  },
  {
   "question": "How many arena points does full Season 1 gear cost?",
   "answer": "The five set pieces total roughly 8,250 arena points (helm/chest/legs 1,875 each, shoulders 1,500, gloves 1,125) plus about 3,750 for a main weapon. Use the arena points calculator to turn your weekly rating into a purchase timeline."
  }
 ]
